    "evidence": [
      "Recover the complete565-byte voxel-record loader6381F0..638425 and remove its original-address forwarder. CaviarData::init is its real product caller; all record parser/allocation/error helpers are already in caviar.cpp.",
      "Permit coherent CvrRecord ownership/type repair and affected Caviar users rather than retaining void-pointer field arithmetic to protect local matches. Original loader allocates0x44 and writes+0x40; existing CvrRecord ends+0x38, so independently establish full record layout and preserve all lifecycle/format/error paths.",
      "All mapped caviar.cpp subjects are granted for coupled record/API repair, not arbitrary changes. Other files outside explicit scope need coordinator expansion. No shared Console/vehicle files may be edited. Root handles bindings, Git and integration; preserve original claims, seed provenance and baseline."
    ],
